                            <div class="space-y-4 md:space-y-6">
                                            <h1 class="type-beta">One big downside of <span class="caps">LNG</span> exports: Price swings for <span class="caps">US</span> gas consumers</h1>

                                                    <div class="prose prose-sans prose-sans-lg xl:prose-sans-xl">
                                The global gas trade has brought new volatility home to domestic markets — a&nbsp;factor the White House is considering as it reassesses the <span class="caps">LNG</span> buildout.
                            </div>
                        
                        <div class="flex gap-5 justify-between items-center">
                                                            <div>
                                    
